<title>SWEDEN: Saab Auto says U.S. March car sales fell 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Saab Auto says U.S. March car sales fell 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car maker Saab Automobile said on Thursday its U.S. car sales fell 18 percent to 2,012 cars in March from the same month a year ago.</p>
</text>
